2.	Node JS',14,'Java, UI & (Angular)_Full Stack Journey_Aug'' SBU1''24','sujit.kumar@irissoftware.com, shiv.agarwal@irissoftware.com, sumisha.k@irissoftware.com, aakanksha.pandey@irissoftware.com, ketan.valsangkar@irissoftware.com','SYSTEM', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'SYSTEM', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
